CONCLUSION: top order p^{k+1} of A_{2k} is a SIGNED sum over EVEN CACTI
(all biconnected blocks even cycles), NOT a +1-per-bigon-tree count.
Bigon-trees over-count (1,3,13,69,...); even-cycle cacti correct to C_k.
R(p)->e (Part C) needs NO Weil: V=2k case is tr(M^{2k})=(-p)^k(p-1), exact.
Error is O(p^k); R-e relative correction O(1/p), supporting 1/p rate.
